QgkumQq8g4le6zA_5_9">7,852,000</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.65%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:0.98%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:8.42%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wfDCJ28O70GCVLuaWEr9Fg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_jk1p7YKeKEu_EF44ovLRzg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:FinancialLiabilitiesFairValueDisclosure" scale="0" id="Tc_BHWQYnm0hUK3wjwVFBtsSQ_5_12">7,852,000</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">There were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wfDCJ28O70GCVLuaWEr9Fg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_0uirX0xCxEGYKKY-deGFbg" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="aktx:FairValueMeasurementRecurringBasisLiabilityTransfersBetweenLevel1AndLevel2Net" scale="0" id="Narr_QSculOlmBkGvk3r5t1Ud3w">no</ix:nonFraction> transfers between Level 1, Level 2 and Level <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wfDCJ28O70GCVLuaWEr9Fg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_0uirX0xCxEGYKKY-deGFbg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationRecurringBasisLiabilityTransfersNet" scale="0" id="Narr_0FPNbvfBIkGImHu7QKKE4g">3</ix:nonFraction> during the year ended December 31, 2022.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Series A and Series B Warrants</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The fair value of the warrant liability is based on significant inputs not observable in the market, which represents a Level 3 measurement within the fair value hierarchy.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On September 14, 2022, the Company&#8217;s sale of ADSs to accredited and institutional investors (See Note 4) also included the issuance of series A and series B warrants. The series A warrants allow the investors to purchase an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pOxpcyINqkenL47mpfq9og" contextRef="As_Of_9_14_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_aktx_SeriesWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_aktx_RegisteredDirectOfferingMember_hmHMGoCDQUSq_bhNK4ZCEg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_jfsss_OP60O9L5wAO4O5dA">15,100,000</ix:nonFraction> ADSs at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_az7XhbQSF0Knro_rjWaBkw" contextRef="As_Of_9_14_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_aktx_SeriesWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_aktx_RegisteredDirectOfferingMember_hmHMGoCDQUSq_bhNK4ZCEg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_XV-Z-qA_tkaXJ5XtkztL1Q">0.85</ix:nonFraction> per ADS (&#8220;Series A warrants&#8221;). The Series A warrants are immediately exercisable and expire <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_9_14_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_aktx_SeriesWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_aktx_RegisteredDirectOfferingMember_hmHMGoCDQUSq_bhNK4ZCEg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" id="Narr_5zQUaH3AskaLiBOugLZHWA">two years</ix:nonNumeric> from issuance (September 14, 2024). The series B warrants allow the investors to purchase an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pOxpcyINqkenL47mpfq9og" contextRef="As_Of_9_14_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_aktx_SeriesBWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_aktx_RegisteredDirectOfferingMember_JGvfA2kjCkilYWtkEfP-NA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_vzQLf3puSkChEQPxypEdDQ">15,100,000</ix:nonFraction> ADSs at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_az7XhbQSF0Knro_rjWaBkw" contextRef="As_Of_9_14_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_aktx_SeriesBWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_aktx_RegisteredDirectOfferingMember_JGvfA2kjCkilYWtkEfP-NA" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_xyNFp0FcfESz6ti6cPViyw">0.85</ix:nonFraction> per ADS (&#8220;Series B warrants&#8221;). The Series B warrants are immediately exercisable and expire <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_9_14_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_aktx_SeriesBWarrantsMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_aktx_RegisteredDirectOfferingMember_JGvfA2kjCkilYWtkEfP-NA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" id="Narr_8PFrSmsmbU2lu6WTeDxGCA">seven years</ix:nonNumeric> from issuance (September 14, 2029). The Series A warrants and the Series B warrants may be exercised on a cashless basis if <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_9_14_2022_To_9_14_2022_tEd--QiNB0q0VBf_kn0lcg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="aktx:ThresholdPeriodForExerciseOfWarrantsOnCashlessBasis" id="Narr_pUD7nf9KEUiuduQ0rjK4JA">six months</ix:nonNumeric> after issuance there is no effective registration statement registering the ADSs underlying the warrants. Pursuant to the cashless exercise provision, the warrant holder must make an additional payment to the Company equal to the nominal value of an ADS (i.e., $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_az7XhbQSF0Knro_rjWaBkw" contextRef="As_Of_9_14_2022_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_aktx_RegisteredDirectOfferingMember_OeMUyexGtUCEUcGTx1nV5Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_0K-03ze4w0WVfShcOebaBQ">0.0001</ix:nonFraction>) per warrant ADS to be issued pursuant to the cashless exercise. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The fair value of the Series A and Series B warrants was determined using the Black-Scholes Option Pricing Model, which uses various assumptions, including (i) fair value of the Company&#8217;s ADSs, (ii) exercise price of the warrant, (iii) expected term of the warrant, (iv) expected volatility and (v) expected risk-free interest rate. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Below are the assumptions used for the fair value calculations of warrants issued on September 14, 2022:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_0uirX0xCxEGYKKY-deGFbg" name="aktx:DisclosureOfFairValueAssumptionsOfWarrantsTableTextBlock" id="Tb_OlJddd7YkEGiX8algg6Exg" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr st