es New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The aggregate intrinsic value of options is calculated as the difference between the exercise price of the options and the fair value of the Company&#8217;s common stock for those options that had exercise prices lower than the fair value of the Company&#8217;s common stock. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pOxpcyINqkenL47mpfq9og" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2020_To_12_31_2020_us-gaap_OptionIndexedToIssuersEquityTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_aktx_NewEquityIncentivePlanMember_vnIQrfcNvUe6cyl-X_ZuMg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_UUn2t5p0TkaYVAZrLKVl5A"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pOxpcyINqkenL47mpfq9og" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_us-gaap_OptionIndexedToIssuersEquityTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_aktx_NewEquityIncentivePlanMember_-BNw3EQ_Q0WREtJw-Rp1iw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_cbbWiEs0NESSg6VFtqBCEw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pOxpcyINqkenL47mpfq9og" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_OptionIndexedToIssuersEquityTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_aktx_NewEquityIncentivePlanMember_nnlOAOqIvEmMg2HM2D0OCg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_nVqx7ZWQMUSZFHJr64CVgQ">No</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> stock option awards were exercised during the years ended December 31, 2022, 2021 and 2020.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';fon